#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:152
msgid "## 工具架构（三层）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:155
msgid ""
"工具层是逸灵风能力的来源，分三层注册，但向 LLM 暴露为**统一的扁平的 tool "
"list**。 LLM 不关心一个工具来自哪一层，只关心它叫什么名字、接受什么参数。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:165
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"LLM 视角 — flat tool list:\n"
"  file_read_file(path)           ← 本地\n"
"  file_write_file(path, content) ← 本地\n"
"  code_execute(code)             ← 本地\n"
"  query_database(sql)            ← MCP Server A\n"
"  send_email(to, subject)        ← MCP Server B\n"
"  acp_cursor(goal, context)      ← ACP 实例\n"
"  acp_booking(goal, context)     ← ACP 实例\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:172
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"逸灵风内部:\n"
"  Registry (flat, 按注册顺序展平)\n"
"    ├─ 本地工具   ← @tool / registry.register()\n"
"    ├─ MCP 工具   ← MCP Client 启动后批量注册\n"
"    └─ ACP 工具   ← ACP Client 启动后每个实例注册一个 tool\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:174
msgid "### 第一层：本地工具（Local）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:176
msgid ""
"本地工具写在 `capabilities/tools/`，通过 `registerTool()` 注册到 `@freeanima/"
"engine-tool` 的 registry。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:178 docs/concepts/architecture.md:201
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:248
#, no-wrap
msgid "**特征：**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid "代码在逸灵风进程内直接执行"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid "启动时 `registerAllTools()` 统一注册"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:182
msgid "最可靠、最低延迟"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:184
#, no-wrap
msgid "**注册方式：**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:193
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```typescript\n"
"registerTool({\n"
"  name: \"file_read_file\",\n"
"  description: \"Read a text file\",\n"
"  parameters: { name: \"file_read_file\", description: \"...\", parameters: { type: \"object\", ... } },\n"
"  handler: (args) => toolResult({ ok: true }),\n"
"});\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:195
#, no-wrap
msgid "**目录约定：** `capabilities/tools/src/*.ts`，由 `registerAllTools()` 导入。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:197
msgid "### 第二层：MCP 工具（Model Context Protocol）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:199
msgid ""
"MCP 工具通过 MCP Client 连接外部 MCP Server，每个 Server 可以注册多个细粒度工"
"具。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "每个 MCP Server 是独立进程（stdio 或 SSE 传输）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "每个 Server 自声明它的 tool schema 列表"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "MCP Client 收集所有 Server 的 schema，批量注册到逸灵风 registry"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "Server 进程由 MCP Client 管理生命周期（启动/保活/关闭）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid ""
"工具名前缀：**无固定前缀**（MCP Server 声明的原名，如 `query_database`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:208
msgid "工具粒度：单一函数调用（如 `query_database(sql)`），非任务级"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:210 docs/concepts/architecture.md:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "**配置方式（config.yaml）：**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:221
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"mcp_servers:\n"
"  database:\n"
"    command: npx @modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres\n"
"    args: [\"--connection\", \"postgresql://...\"]\n"
"    transport: stdio\n"
"  email:\n"
"    url: http://email-mcp-server:8080\n"
"    transport: sse\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:223 docs/concepts/architecture.md:275
#, no-wrap
msgid "**注册流程：**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"逸灵风启动 → 读取 mcp_servers 配置\n"
"         → 对每个配置启动 MCP Server（子进程 / TCP 连接）\n"
"         → 调用 servers/tools/list 获取工具列表\n"
"         → 每个工具注册到逸灵风 registry（name 保持原名）\n"
"         → LLM 调用时，MCP Client 根据 tool name 路由到正确的 Server\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:233 docs/concepts/architecture.md:287
#, no-wrap
msgid "**调用流程：**\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:242
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"LLM 调 query_database(sql)\n"
"  → engine 在 registry 中查找 → tool 绑定 MCP Client\n"
"  → MCP Client 确定该 tool 属于哪个 Server\n"
"  → 通过 stdio/SSE 发送 tools/call 请求\n"
"  → 等待 Server 返回\n"
"  → 返回结果给 engine\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:244
msgid "### 第三层：ACP 工具（Agent Client Protocol）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:246
msgid "ACP 工具连接外部 ACP Agent 实例，**每个实例**注册为**一个**任务级工具。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid ""
"配置负责启动命令；**适配器**（`adapter: cursor` 等）负责方言（流式通知、权"
"限、扩展 RPC），见 `integrations/src/acp/adapters/`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "每个 ACP 实例是一个独立 Agent（子进程或远程服务）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "每个实例只注册**一个**工具：`acp_{name}(goal, context)` → 结果"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "工具名前缀：**固定 `acp_`**，如 `acp_cursor`、`acp_booking`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "工具粒度：完整任务委托（\"分析代码库并写报告\"），非单次函数调用"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "ACP 实例可以有自己的记忆、身份、工具、秘密——逸灵风不关心也不感知"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid ""
"实例可以是纯工具（Cursor Agent），也可以是有自我意识的数字生命——对逸灵风无区"
"别"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:257
msgid "逸灵风与 ACP 实例的关系是\"雇主与承包商\"，不是\"主进程与子进程\""
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:273
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"acp_agents:\n"
"  cursor:\n"
"    command: ~/.local/bin/agent\n"
"    args: [\"--force\", \"acp\"]\n"
"    name: cursor\n"
"    description: \"委托编码、重构、代码审查任务\"\n"
"  booking:\n"
"    url: acp://booking-agent:8080\n"
"    transport: sse\n"
"    name: booking\n"
"    description: \"委托机票和酒店预订任务\"\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:283
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"逸灵风启动 → 读取 acp_agents 配置\n"
"         → registerTools 向 registry 注册 acp_{name}\n"
"         → startAllAsync 后台连接 enabled !== false 的 agent（stdio JSON-RPC）\n"
"         → 连接超时 connect_timeout_ms（默认 15s）；prompt 超时 prompt_timeout_ms（默认 120s）\n"
"         → LLM 看到 acp_cursor(goal, context)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:285
msgid ""
"> 当前仅实现 stdio transport；配置中的 `url` / `transport: sse` 尚未接入。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:296
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"LLM 调 acp_cursor(goal=\"重构 auth 模块\", context=\"...\")\n"
"  → engine 找到 acp_cursor tool，绑定 cursor ACP Client\n"
"  → 默认复用当前逸灵风 session 在 `session_meta.acp_sessions[cursor]` 的 ACP session；`new_session: true` 强制新建\n"
"  → Client 通过 ACP 协议发送任务（goal + context），同 agent 上请求串行排队\n"
"  → 等待 ACP Agent 完成（可能几分钟）\n"
"  → 返回 JSON（`session_id`、`output`、`new_session`、`reused_binding` 等）给 engine\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:298
msgid "### 三层对比"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:309
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 维度        | 本地工具               | MCP 工具                   | ACP 工具          |\n"
"| ----------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------- | ----------------- |\n"
"| 执行位置    | 逸灵风进程内           | 外部 Server 子进程         | 外部 Agent 子进程 |\n"
"| 粒度        | 单次函数               | 单次函数                   | 完整任务          |\n"
"| 延迟        | 毫秒级                 | 毫秒~秒级                  | 秒~分钟级         |\n"
"| 注册方式    | 自动发现               | 配置 + 协议发现            | 配置 + 固定签名   |\n"
"| 名称前缀    | 原名（由 Server 声明） | 原生 `mcp_{server}_{tool}` | 固定 `acp_`       |\n"
"| 实例/工具比 | 1:1                    | 1:N                        | 1:1               |\n"
"| 独立身份？  | 否                     | 否                         | 可（透明）        |\n"
"| 生命周期    | 逸灵风启动/关闭        | Client 管理                | Client 管理       |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:311
msgid "### 混合场景"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:313
msgid "三层不是互斥的。一个场景可以同时使用多层："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:320
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"LLM 分析数据库异常:\n"
"  1. acp_cursor(\"检查 users 表的相关代码\")     ← ACP：让 Cursor 分析代码\n"
"  2. query_database(\"SELECT * FROM users ...\") ← MCP：查数据库\n"
"  3. file_write_file(\"analysis.md\", content)   ← 本地：写结果到文件\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:322
msgid "LLM 自己决定用什么工具、什么顺序。逸灵风只负责注册和路由。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:324
msgid "## WebUI 架构"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:326
msgid ""
"WebUI 是 React 19 CSR 应用（`connectors/webui/`），由 `anima service` 在同一 "
"HTTP 端口（默认 **2658**）提供页面与 tRPC API。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:328
msgid "### 服务拓扑"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:339
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"浏览器 ──HTTP/SSE/WS──→ Bun.serve（2658）\n"
"                              │\n"
"                              ├─ /api/trpc/*（HTTP batch + SSE subscription）\n"
"                              ├─ /api/trpc/ws（终端 WebSocket，Bun 原生 upgrade）\n"
"                              ├─ /api/health\n"
"                              ├─ /webui/*（默认生产 bundle；--dev 时 HMR）\n"
"                              └─ tRPC router → AnimaService（进程内）\n"
"                         AnimaService / EventBus / Gateway（同进程）\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:341
msgid "### 前端三态"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:343
msgid "同一 SPA 内三个独立态，可切换，不共享布局与本地状态："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:349
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 态     | 路由前缀           | 角色                                                  |\n"
"| ------ | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 会客厅 | `/webui/parlor/*`  | 与 Agent 对话                                         |\n"
"| 卧室   | `/webui/chamber/*` | 记忆、配置、工具与系统维护（旧 `/workshop` 重定向）   |\n"
"| 创作室 | `/webui/studio/*`  | 协同工作台：结对编程（占位）、长篇/短视频（即将推出） |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:351
msgid "### API 层"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:357
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 机制      | 说明                                                                             |\n"
"| --------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| tRPC      | 主要 JSON API（会话、状态、记忆、MCP/ACP、studio 等）；聊天流用 SSE subscription |\n"
"| REST      | `GET /api/health`（CLI 探针）                                                    |\n"
"| WebSocket | `WS /api/trpc/ws`（创作室 xterm `studio.terminal.*`）                            |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:359
msgid "### 启动"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:367
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"anima service start              # systemd --user（默认；WebUI 生产 bundle + hash 缓存）\n"
"anima service start --foreground # 前台阻塞（便于看日志）\n"
"anima service start --dev        # WebUI 源码 watch 重建（静态 Serving，改代码后刷新页面）\n"
"anima service status\n"
"# 浏览器访问 http://127.0.0.1:2658/webui/parlor/chat\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:369
msgid ""
"WebUI 由 [`connectors/webui/src/webui-server.ts`](../../connectors/webui/src/"
"webui-server.ts) 在 `serve()` 内启动：默认对 `connectors/webui/app/"
"index.html` 做 AOT 构建，产物缓存于 `~/.anima/runtime/webui-build/{hash}/`"
"（源码 hash 未变则跳过重建）；`--dev` 写入 `~/.anima/runtime/webui-dev-build/"
"` 并 `Bun.build` watch 增量重建（静态 Serving，非 HTMLBundle HMR）。Tailwind "
"经 `bun-plugin-tailwind` 在 `Bun.build` 中显式注入。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:371
msgid "## 事件系统"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:373
msgid "### EventBus（已有）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:375
#, no-wrap
msgid "**异步 after-the-fact 通知模式。** 组件不直接调用对方，而是发射事件，由注册的处理器链处理。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:381
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"conversation 落盘 → emit(\"session:updated\")\n"
"  └─ registerMemoryPipeline 注册浅睡 / 深睡等处理器\n"
"  └─ 语义记忆写入 → emit(\"semantic_memory:updated\")\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:383
msgid "特征："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:388
msgid "同步写入 SQLite 表（微秒级），后台线程轮询执行"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:388
msgid "处理器链在同一次轮询中顺序执行，前一个失败则中断链"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:388
msgid "失败重试（最多 3 次），不会丢失事件"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:388
msgid "用于**发生后该做什么**的场景：浅睡提取、深睡维护、索引通知"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:390
msgid "### Hooks（`@freeanima/kernel-hooks`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:392
#, no-wrap
msgid "**同步 interceptor 模式。** 注册表在 `@freeanima/kernel-hooks`：`run(context)` 返回 `HookRunResult`（`context` 只读、`chain` 经 `prev` 串联；聚合 `blocked` / `blockedMessage`）。领域 **context 类型** 在 [`kernel/hooks/src/domain-hooks.ts`](../../kernel/hooks/src/domain-hooks.ts)；`kernel` 单例见 [`service/bootstrap/src/kernel.ts`](../../service/bootstrap/src/kernel.ts)。\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:394
msgid "语义要点："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:399
msgid ""
"handler 返回 `{ status, blocked?: boolean, message?, data? }`；**不**原地改 "
"context；业务日志在 handler 注册处自行记录。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:399
msgid ""
"**短路**：仅 `status: \"ok\"` 且 `blocked === true`；原因写在 `message`，聚合"
"为 `HookRunResult.blockedMessage`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:399
msgid ""
"**`status: \"failed\"`**：入链但**不**挡后续 handler；`run()` **不** throw。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:399
msgid ""
"调用方读 `run.blocked` / `run.blockedMessage`；效应用 "
"`headOkStepData(run.chain)`（链头方向第一个 ok 步的 `data`，多 handler 时以最"
"后执行的为准）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:401
msgid "已接入点（hook token）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:405
msgid "`messageIncoming` — `AnimaService` 入站"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:405
msgid "`turnAfterComplete` — 单轮结束"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:405
msgid "`toolAfterCall` — 工具返回后"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:407
msgid ""
"`@freeanima/capabilities-clarify` 在 `serve()` 里通过 "
"`registerClarifyHooks(kernel)` 挂载 handler。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:409
msgid "与 EventBus 的关系："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:417
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 维度         | EventBus                       | Hooks                                                       |\n"
"| ------------ | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 时序         | 发生后                         | 发生前/中/后                                                |\n"
"| 调用方式     | 异步（轮询）                   | 同步（`await kernel.hookRegistry.run`）                     |\n"
"| 能否修改数据 | 不能                           | 经 `data` 返回效应，由 fold 合并                            |\n"
"| 错误语义     | 链中断                         | failed 步可继续；`ok`+`blocked` 短路                        |\n"
"| 实现状态     | ✅ `registerMemoryPipeline` 等 | ✅ `@freeanima/kernel-hooks` + `@freeanima/service-logging` |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:419
msgid ""
"记忆管道入口为 `registerMemoryPipeline`（`@freeanima/life-memory`）。Hooks 不"
"是 EventBus 的替代品，两者互补。"
msgstr ""

